# ── Documentation / internal notes — NEVER deploy ──────────────────────────
# These files describe the apps' internals and may reference real personal
# data (PII). They must never reach the live Pages site.
**/AGENTS.md
**/design.md
**/session_handoff.md
**/requirements.md
**/testcase.md
**/README.md

# ── Development / test harnesses — not part of the deployed apps ──────────
dev/
.stfolder/

# ── Personal documents / source artefacts — NEVER deploy ──────────────────
# Bills, receipts, scans, screenshots and similar files produced by the
# apps live on the user's machine, not in the repo. Guard them here so
# nothing containing PII can be committed and served publicly.
*.pdf

